# UV
.uv/
# uv.lock is DELIBERATELY tracked. Townlet is an application, not a library: the
# lockfile is the only artifact that makes an environment reproducible, and a
# project whose spine is content-addressed provenance cannot ship without one.
# It was ignored here until 2026-08-11.

