# Data
data/
*.csv
!.claude/skills/**/*.json
# WARNING: this `*.json` is GLOBAL despite sitting under "# Data". It is the root
# cause WS-0 (hamlet-8eeaba1461) is chasing: it silently excluded the frontend's
# package metadata from version control, which is why hamlet-d892e161c0 reads as
# "package.json is missing" rather than "package.json was never committable".
# The negation above shows someone hit this before and patched one case instead
# of the rule. Narrowing it fully is WS-0's call — it also catches .mcp.json and
# the plan review artifacts, which need their own triage.
*.json
# Dependency manifests are never data. These MUST be tracked.
!frontend/package.json
!frontend/package-lock.json
!package.json
!package-lock.json
# Project-level Claude Code settings are policy, not data: they carry the PDR-0101 merge
# permission and the session hooks. Tracked deliberately (2026-09-02); settings.local.json stays ignored.
!.claude/settings.json
*.pkl
*.pickle

# Database files (SQLite)
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Logs
*.log

# Frontend
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.vite/

# Documentation builds
docs/_build/
site/
.worktrees/

test_migration_checkpoints/*

# DO NOT
*.backup
*.orig
*.rej
*.broken

*.msgpack

tmp/
tmp_4m_debug/
tmp_sim_4m/

# Filigree issue tracker
.filigree/

# Filigree issue tracker
.weft/
# Wardline scan artifacts
.wardline/
findings.jsonl

# Filigree server-mode MCP config embeds a literal federation token
.mcp.json

# Claude Code agent worktrees (transient; never track)
.claude/worktrees/

# Product evidence records are versioned even where they are csv/json (M4 baselines, PDR-0141)
!docs/product/baselines/**
